cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these models, please cite the underlying corpora (ARTUR 1.0 and
  Sloleks 3.1) as well as, or instead of, this repository. They are the
  substantive contribution; this is a recipe and a set of weights built on them.
title: "Open Slovene Speech: TTS and ASR models for Slovene"
abstract: >-
  A Slovene text-to-speech voice (Piper/VITS, 22.05 kHz, lexicon-based
  phonemizer) and a Slovene speech-recognition model (Whisper large-v3 with a
  LoRA adapter, 7.77% WER against 18.41% for the stock model), trained on the
  publicly available ARTUR 1.0 corpus and the Sloleks 3.1 morphological lexicon.
type: software
authors:
  # CFF 'entity' form: a handle rather than a personal name.
  - name: "dl1ch"
    website: "https://github.com/dl1ch"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/dl1ch/open-slovene-speech/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dl1ch/open-slovene-speech"
keywords:
  - Slovene
  - slovenščina
  - speech recognition
  - text-to-speech
  - ASR
  - TTS
  - Whisper
  - VITS
  - low-resource languages
